proxmox-kernel-7.3 (7.3.6-1+s390x1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * s390x port: build for IBM Z (s390x), booted through zipl.
  * s390x: kernel config based on the Debian s390x config of the 7.3 series
    plus the common Proxmox overrides; additionally enable vfio-ccw, vfio-ap,
